OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FEarly showers across Caithness
OL,6,Fand Sutherland will clear, leaving a
OL,7,Fbright day with plenty of sunny
OL,8,Fspells. Sunshine will turn a little
OL,9,Fhazy at times through the afternoon.
OL,10,FMainly light winds, a moderate
OL,11,Fnorthwesterly at first over Caithness.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FSome evening then most areas
OL,14,Fdry with some clear spells tonight.
OL,15,
OL,16,CTuesday:FA mostly dry day though cloud
OL,17,Fmay be thick enough in the morning for
OL,18,Fthe odd spot of rain. Some bright
OL,19,Fspells and some hazy sunshine breaking
OL,20,Fthrough, slightly warmer.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
